<title>USA: American Classic Voyages Co Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>American Classic Voyages Co Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $1.62   profit	$ 0.01</p>
<p> Net profit		22,403   profit	   197</p>
<p> Revs			50,233		   47,873</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,861		   13,992</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 includes $0.57/shr gain on sale of Maison Dupuy Hotel in October 1996.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 1.28     loss	$ 0.70</p>
<p> Net loss		  17,636     loss	 9,671</p>
<p> Revs		     191,542		  189,821</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,802		   13,763</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 full-year results include writedown of $38.4 million ($1.89/shr after tax) related to company's decision to retire one of its steamships.</p>
<p>1995 year results include one-time charge of $5.9 million ($0.28/shr after tax) for costs associated with the American Queen introduction.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
